{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24799","headline":"江亭寓目 · 卢拱","name":"江亭寓目","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江郭带林峦，津亭倚槛看。\n水风蒲叶战，沙雨鹭鹚寒。\n晚木初凋柳，秋丛欲败兰。\n哀猨自相叫，乡泪好无端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢拱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}